      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so i've been feeling super fatigued and my muscles have been twitching a lot lately. i know i have stage 3 kidney disease so i'm supposed to be careful, but i read that sometimes those symptoms happen because your potassium is too low. if i bought those 99mg potassium supplements, do u think it would be okay to take like 5 of them every morning to just kind of \"reset\" my levels and flush out the imbalance? i feel like a big dose might help my body catch up.",
